sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant IngestGW as Ingestion Gateway
    participant IngestCtrl as Ingest Controller
    participant StorageSvc as Storage Service
    participant MediaRepo as Media Repository
    participant S3 as S3/MinIO Bucket
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    User->>IngestGW: POST /ingest/upload/init<br/>{mimeType, sizeBytes}
    IngestGW->>IngestCtrl: Forward request

    IngestCtrl->>IngestCtrl: Validate file type & size
    alt Invalid file
        IngestCtrl-->>User: 400 Invalid File
    end

    IngestCtrl->>StorageSvc: Initialize upload
    StorageSvc->>StorageSvc: Generate unique storageKey
    StorageSvc->>MediaRepo: Create MediaAsset<br/>{status: "uploading"}
    MediaRepo-->>StorageSvc: Asset created {assetId}

    StorageSvc->>S3: Generate pre-signed multipart URLs
    S3-->>StorageSvc: Upload URLs

    StorageSvc-->>IngestCtrl: Upload details
    IngestCtrl-->>User: 200 OK<br/>{assetId, uploadUrls[]}

    loop For each part
        User->>IngestGW: POST /ingest/upload/part<br/>{partNumber, contentRange}
        IngestGW->>IngestCtrl: Forward part
        IngestCtrl->>StorageSvc: Validate & store part
        StorageSvc->>S3: Upload part
        S3-->>StorageSvc: Part stored
        StorageSvc-->>IngestCtrl: Part complete
        IngestCtrl-->>User: 200 OK
    end

    User->>IngestGW: POST /ingest/upload/complete<br/>{assetId}
    IngestGW->>IngestCtrl: Finalize upload

    IngestCtrl->>StorageSvc: Complete multipart upload
    StorageSvc->>S3: Combine all parts
    S3-->>StorageSvc: File ready

    StorageSvc->>MediaRepo: Update MediaAsset<br/>{status: "ready", generate signed URL}
    MediaRepo-->>StorageSvc: Updated

    StorageSvc->>EventBus: Emit media.ingested<br/>{assetId}

    StorageSvc-->>IngestCtrl: Upload complete
    IngestCtrl-->>User: 200 OK<br/>{assetId, confirmation}